# Secrets and local overrides
.env
.env.local
.claude/settings.local.json

# NOTE: .claude/agents/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The quickstart tells you to
# copy the directorate Leads there; ignoring that path would silently drop them
# from your commit and leave a fresh clone with no directorates to dispatch.

# Scratch work — decrees and run transcripts kept out of the record
scratch/
runs/
*.local.md
